{"title":"Closer Contacts"}
</properties>
<content>
<callout icon="👥" color="gray_bg">
	Every booking gets a direct Slack message to the closer within 5 minutes — never assume they saw the calendar. This page is the roster.
</callout>
### Management
- **Daniel** — sales manager / operator. Slack DM for anything broken, any question, any pay issue. Questions go by DM, not channels.
### Closers
Added as closers are onboarded. Format for each: Name — Slack handle — phone — Calendly link — timezone/hours.
- *(No closers onboarded yet — roster fills as Module 16 hiring completes.)*
### Setter → Closer Handoff Rules
- Slack the closer directly on every confirmed booking with a 1–2 sentence summary + "full notes in CRM"
- Closer running long? You keep the next lead warm — nobody sits alone in a Zoom waiting room
- Reschedules, link resends, and calendar conflicts are setter problems; the closer's one job is being fully present on calls
- Check your closers' calendar availability at the start of every shift
</content>
</page>
